<title>NORWAY: Elf spuds appraisal well offshore Angola.</title>
<headline>Elf spuds appraisal well offshore Angola.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operator Elf Petroleum has spudded an appraisal well on the deepwater Girassol oil discovery offshore Angola, Den norske stats oljeselskap AS said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The discovery was made earlier this year, Statoil's  Status Weekly newsletter said.</p>
<p>An alliance between Statoil and British Petroleum Co Plc holds 30 percent in the licence.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
